  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-372ff951-7fff-c608-fd06-cd0b222cf64a\">While most toil in the dirty streets, you knew a life above all that. Your life was one of luxury: you attended many high end social events, and you spent a good part of your life learning to navigate the treacherous waters of upper class etiquette. Perhaps you were born into wealth, or perhaps you or your family found a way to gain it. Regardless, you have always known that in the world of the rich, it only takes a few mistakes before you are thrown out of the ivory tower and onto the streets below. So, what were your mistakes?</strong></p><hr /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Skill Proficiencies: </strong>Persuasion, plus your choice of Deception or Insight</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tool Proficiencies: </strong>None</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Languages: </strong>Two of your choice</p><p><strong>Equipment: </strong>A set of fine clothes, a signet ring with a symbol of your family, a smartphone, a cryptostick containing 2500 cp</p><p><strong>Feature: </strong>@UUID[Compendium.cyberpunk-5e.cyberpunk-backgrounds.Item.sqWUAlvGzfeBBRKg]{Social Standing}</p>",
